Screenshots land here.

CI captures every screen in light and dark on each push and uploads them as the
`emulator-screenshots` artifact. Download that artifact from the workflow run,
drop the images you want to keep into this folder, and reference them from
README.md — the table under "Screenshots" lists the filenames CI produces.

They are kept out of CI's own commit deliberately: a workflow that pushes
regenerated binaries back into the repository turns every UI tweak into a diff
nobody reads.
